      "message": "Yes, that\u0027s where the non-PD devices end up.  That could be an appropriate location to clear the hard reset flag, assuming that\u0027s what the AP prefers.\n\nPrashant, what specific timing does the AP need out of the hard reset flag?  I know at one point, we\u0027d discussed always presenting it to possibly use for tracking which partner connections encounter errors, but it seems like its sole purpose right now is deeply tied to the mux programming requirements.",
